course: dictionary
lesson: 3835
title: Fortieth: position and part
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some numbers tell you where something comes in a line. Fortieth is one of these: it means coming as number 40 in a row or order. The fortieth child in the queue is the one just after the thirty-ninth.
explain: Fortieth can also mean one of forty equal parts. One fortieth is written 1/40, and it is the same as 0.025. If a cake is cut into forty equal slices, each slice is one fortieth of the cake.
explain: Look at the clues in «the Evanses invite the whole street to their fortieth anniversary». An anniversary comes round once a year, and this one is the fortieth, so fortieth is a position in a row of years. Families use it for birthdays too: «Mum's fortieth» means her fortieth birthday.
fact: Fortieth is an ordinal number: it tells you the position, like first, second and third.
fact: One fortieth means one of forty equal parts, written 1/40.
fact: One fortieth is the same as 0.025 in decimals.
fact: «Fortieth birthday» and «fortieth anniversary» are phrases you will hear at family parties.
fact: A fortieth can also be a noun: «a fortieth» is one part out of forty, and «fortieths» means more than one part.
exercise: In «the Evanses invite the whole street to their fortieth anniversary», which word tells you the anniversary is number 40 in a row? | the | *fortieth | street | whole
exercise: How do you write one fortieth as a fraction? | *1/40 | 1/14 | 40/1 | 1/4
exercise: What is one fortieth as a decimal? | 0.04 | *0.025 | 0.4 | 0.25
test: Ella is the 40th in the queue. Which word gives her place? | fourth | forty-first | fourteenth | *fortieth
test: A cake is cut into forty equal slices. What fraction is one slice? | *1/40 | 4/40 | 1/4 | 40/1
exam: Mum's fortieth birthday is on Saturday. What does fortieth tell us? | It is her shoe size | It is a fraction of her cake | *It is the 40th birthday in her life | It is the number of guests coming
